Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:41:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(kernel): preserve validated STEP edges when healing
 exceeds the gap limit

Compare the source solid when a rejected repair removes edges. Recheck the original topology and geometry before using it. Report both gaps when the source also exceeds the limit.

Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

